  "summary": "Coupe (19437) rear roof area: rear window glass, the rear roof upper molding (chrome strip above the rear window) and the vertical rear roof lower molding, plus the door glass rear seal (side glass weatherstrip) on the lock pillar and the sealing strip under the upper molding. The upper molding is held by screws driven up from under the rear roof panel through washers; the plate and guide at the molding ends are screwed down; the lower molding and the door glass seal are riveted, and the seal is also glued. Related sheets: F17, F19 (rear window).",
